## Findings from the code (not guesses)
  C1 Two layouts live side by side: 48 tools in domains/music/organisms/<id>/ (flat, specs in specs/, presets inside the
     engine code, a hand-kept load list) and 3 tools in domains/music/tools/<category>/<id>/ (the 3.32 layout: tool.json,
     spec, packs/ beside the code, a GENERATED loader). That split is why adding things is confusing: two places, two
     loaders, two pack mechanisms (PresetPacks data files and ContentPacks pack.json).
  C2 The other domains exist only as specs (image 12, video 9, ui 11, agents 12 — status MAPPED); nothing runs.
  C3 The start screen offers MODES of the one installed domain; there is no "pick what you are making" step.
  C4 Specs: 48 music tools have one, in specs/ (not beside the code); 9 music specs describe tools never built
